<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Battery Alert Escalation Pending</title></head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #1a1a1a;">
  <h2 style="color: #d93025;">⚠️ Critical Alert chưa ack</h2>
  <p>Một Critical anomaly trên battery asset <strong>{{AssetSerialNumber}}</strong>
     chưa được acknowledge trong vòng <strong>{{MinutesSinceDetection}} phút</strong>
     kể từ khi detect.</p>

  <table style="border-collapse: collapse; margin: 16px 0;">
    <tr><td style="padding: 6px 12px;"><strong>Alert ID</strong></td><td>{{AlertId}}</td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding: 6px 12px;"><strong>Battery Asset</strong></td><td>{{AssetSerialNumber}}</td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding: 6px 12px;"><strong>Anomaly Type</strong></td><td>{{AnomalyType}}</td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding: 6px 12px;"><strong>Severity</strong></td><td>{{Severity}}</td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding: 6px 12px;"><strong>Detected At</strong></td><td>{{DetectedAt}}</td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding: 6px 12px;"><strong>Actual Value</strong></td><td>{{ActualValue}} {{Unit}}</td></tr>
  </table>

  <p style="color: #d93025;"><strong>Action Required:</strong>
     Mở Manager portal → Tickets → Acknowledge ngay để bắt đầu SLA flow.</p>

  <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #ddd;">
  <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #666;">
    Sprint 5B #238. Gửi bởi NotificationService — debounce 5 phút per AlertId.
  </p>
</body>
</html>
